    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Spearpoint Task Force",
    "summary": "Once per battle, you can pick the **assault doctrine** or the **tactical doctrine** of [Combat Doctrines](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines) an extra time.\n\nYour **ADEPTUS ASTARTES MOUNTED** and **ADEPTUS ASTARTES SPEEDER** units get +1 to their [Advance rolls](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move).\n\nYour **SUBODEN KHAN** units get the ability below.\n\n**Wrath of the First Khan**: as [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, if this unit has been **eligible to fight** during the phase, it can move: as a [normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move) if it is **unengaged**, or as a [fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) if it is **engaged**.\n\nYour army can contain **WHITE SCARS** units, and no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
